      "evidence": [
        {
          "sourceId": "en:body",
          "quote": "Yuumi channels for 3.5 seconds, launching 5 magical waves affecting both teams. If initially cast while Attached, Yuumi can steer the waves to follow her mouse. Enemies struck are dealt (75/125/175 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage and Slowed by 10% for 1.25 seconds, increased by 10% per wave hit. Ally champions are healed for (30/50/70 + (12% Ability Power)) health per wave. Excess healing is converted to a Shield instead. Best Friend Bonus: For her Best Friend, the heal is increased to (30/50/70 + (12% Ability Power)) × (1.3 ~ 1.6) health. Casting You and Me! will locks the waves in the current direction. Yuumi can move and cast Zoomies while channeling. Missiles after the first deal (18.75/31.25/43.75 + (6.25% Ability Power)) magic damage. Max possible damage to a single enemy is (150/250/350 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage."
        }
